<title>FINLAND: Kone sets Chinese lift joint-venture.</title>
<headline>Kone sets Chinese lift joint-venture.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish lift-maker Kone Oy said in a statement on Wednesday it would set up a joint venture in China with a target to produce 1,000 lifts and 500 escalators per year in five years' time.</p>
<p>Kone would own 90 percent of the company and its Chinese partner Jiangsu Xing-Ji Group Ltd 10 percent, it said.</p>
</text>
